---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import avatar1 from '../../assets/46d532f33f5ae429_100.jpg';
import avatar2 from '../../assets/07b0c78f5d884bc5_100.jpg';
import avatar3 from '../../assets/5eccb6dd8c3d7b1b_100.jpg';
import avatar4 from '../../assets/b593935ecc8730c1_100.jpg';
import avatar5 from '../../assets/7c61df640bc5483d_100.jpg';
---

<section class="overflow-hidden border-ink/[0.09] sm:px-8 lg:px-10 border-t pt-24 pr-5 pb-24 pl-5 relative" id="reviews">
<div class="absolute top-1/2 left-[20%] -translate-y-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-ink/10 blur-[120px] rounded-full pointer-events-none"></div>
<div class="relative z-10 mx-auto grid w-full max-w-[1280px] gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr] lg:gap-20">
<div class="reveal lg:mt-10">
<p class="text-[13px] font-medium text-ink-soft">05 · Prova social</p>
<h2 class="mt-4 text-4xl text-ink sm:text-[56px] leading-[1.1] tracking-tight font-display font-medium">Feito para times<br/>que querem que o trabalho<br/>pareça óbvio.</h2>
<p class="mt-6 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft max-w-[400px]">O Pulsedesk dá aos times em crescimento uma forma mais tranquila de coordenar projetos sem adotar um sistema operacional pesado.</p>
<div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
<a class="inline-flex h-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-accent-ink px-5 text-sm font-medium text-paper shadow-[0_0_0_1px_rgba(10,37,64,0.08),0_18px_50px_rgba(10,37,64,0.08)] transition hover:bg-accent-ink-strong" href="#">Ler histórias</a>
<a class="inline-flex h-11 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-ink/[0.15] bg-paper/[0.65] px-5 text-sm font-medium text-ink backdrop-blur-xl transition hover:bg-paper/[0.92]" href="#">Começar</a>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-5">

<div class="group relative flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6 rounded-[2rem] bg-linear-to-b from-paper/[0.70] to-transparent p-6 sm:p-8 border border-ink/[0.12]">
<div class="absolute inset-x-4 top-0 h-px bg-linear-to-r from-transparent via-ink-2/40 to-transparent"></div>
<div class="flex h-14 w-14 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border border-ink/[0.08] bg-paper/[0.45] text-ink shadow-[inset_0_0_20px_rgba(10,37,64,0.04)]">
<svg fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path></svg>
</div>
<div class="flex-1">
<h3 class="text-[22px] text-ink font-display font-medium">Mais de 1.200 times pequenos</h3>
<p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">Usam o Pulsedesk para manter tarefas, responsáveis e prazos visíveis sem complicar o processo.</p>
<div class="mt-6 flex items-center gap-4">
<div class="flex -space-x-3">
<Image src={avatar1} alt="Usuário" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full border-2 border-paper object-cover relative z-[4]" width={40} height={40} loading="lazy" />
<Image src={avatar2} alt="Usuário" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full border-2 border-paper object-cover relative z-[3]" width={40} height={40} loading="lazy" />
<Image src={avatar3} alt="Usuário" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full border-2 border-paper object-cover relative z-[2]" width={40} height={40} loading="lazy" />
<Image src={avatar4} alt="Usuário" class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full border-2 border-paper object-cover relative z-[1]" width={40} height={40} loading="lazy" />
<div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full border-2 border-paper bg-mist text-ink text-[10px] font-medium flex items-center justify-center relative z-[0]">+1,2K</div>
</div>
<div class="h-[2px] flex-1 bg-[url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI4IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjIiPjxjaXJjbGUgY3g9IjEiIGN5PSIxIiByPSIxIiBmaWxsPSJyZ2JhKDE0NywgMTk3LCAyNTMsIDAuMykiLz48L3N2Zz4=')] bg-repeat-x opacity-50"></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="group relative flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6 rounded-[2rem] bg-linear-to-b from-paper/[0.70] to-transparent p-6 sm:p-8 border border-ink/[0.12] overflow-hidden">
<div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-1/2 h-full opacity-20 pointer-events-none">
<svg class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-full h-full object-cover" viewBox="0 0 200 100"><path d="M0,100 C50,80 100,120 200,40 L200,100 Z" fill="none" stroke="#0A2540" stroke-dasharray="2 4" stroke-width="0.5"></path><path d="M0,100 C60,70 120,110 200,20 L200,100 Z" fill="none" stroke="#0A2540" stroke-dasharray="2 4" stroke-width="0.5"></path><path d="M0,100 C70,60 140,100 200,0 L200,100 Z" fill="none" stroke="#0A2540" stroke-dasharray="2 4" stroke-width="0.5"></path></svg>
</div>
<div class="absolute inset-x-4 top-0 h-px bg-linear-to-r from-transparent via-ink-2/40 to-transparent"></div>
<div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2 shrink-0">
<div class="flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border border-ink/[0.08] bg-paper/[0.45] shadow-[inset_0_0_20px_rgba(10,37,64,0.04)]">
<svg class="text-ink-soft" fill="currentColor" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24"><path d="M14.017 21v-7.391c0-5.704 3.731-9.57 8.983-10.609l.995 2.151c-2.432.917-3.995 3.638-3.995 5.849h4v10h-9.983zm-14.017 0v-7.391c0-5.704 3.748-9.57 9-10.609l.996 2.151c-2.433.917-3.996 3.638-3.996 5.849h3.983v10h-9.983z"></path></svg>
</div>
<Image src={avatar5} alt="Maya Chen" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-ink/[0.12] object-cover mt-2" width={40} height={40} loading="lazy" />
</div>
<div class="flex-1 relative z-10 pt-2">
<h3 class="text-[22px] text-ink leading-tight font-display font-medium">“Nosso time inteiro entendeu logo no primeiro dia.”</h3>
<p class="mt-4 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft"><span class="text-ink-soft font-medium">Maya Chen</span>, Líder de Estúdio — um workspace leve substituiu três ferramentas dispersas.</p>
</div>
</div>

<div class="group relative flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6 rounded-[2rem] bg-linear-to-b from-paper/[0.70] to-transparent p-6 sm:p-8 border border-ink/[0.12]">
<div class="absolute inset-x-4 top-0 h-px bg-linear-to-r from-transparent via-ink-2/40 to-transparent"></div>
<div class="flex h-14 w-14 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border border-ink/[0.08] bg-paper/[0.45] text-ink shadow-[inset_0_0_20px_rgba(10,37,64,0.04)]">
<svg fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><polyline points="12 6 12 12 16 14"></polyline></svg>
</div>
<div class="flex-1 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-6">
<div class="max-w-[320px]">
<h3 class="text-[22px] text-ink font-display font-medium">Menos tempo gerenciando a ferramenta</h3>
<p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">Os times passam mais tempo fazendo o trabalho e menos tempo mantendo quadros complicados.</p>
</div>
<div class="relative w-[140px] h-[60px] shrink-0 self-start md:self-auto mt-4 md:mt-0">
<div class="absolute -top-10 left-4 rounded-lg border border-ink/[0.12] bg-mist/80 backdrop-blur-xs px-2.5 py-1.5 flex flex-col items-start shadow-xl">
<span class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-accent-ink flex items-center gap-1">↑ 32%</span>
<span class="text-[9px] text-ink-soft">Tempo economizado</span>
</div>
<svg class="w-full h-full overflow-visible" viewBox="0 0 100 40"><path d="M0,35 L20,30 L40,32 L60,18 L80,22 L100,5" fill="none" stroke="#0A2540" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2"></path><path d="M0,35 L20,30 L40,32 L60,18 L80,22 L100,5 L100,40 L0,40 Z" fill="url(#chartGradient)" opacity="0.3"></path><circle class="drop-shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(0,168,142,0.45)]" cx="100" cy="5" fill="#00735F" r="3"></circle><defs><linearGradient id="chartGradient" x1="0" x2="0" y1="0" y2="1"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="#0A2540"></stop><stop offset="100%" stop-color="transparent"></stop></linearGradient></defs></svg>
</div>
</div>
</div>

</div>
</div>
</section>
